                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "scrimping",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f7cad3d-c10d-3bf1-85da-b1882e825746",
                                        "entry_id": "5e94b0ff-330e-3351-8127-e2f737a3736d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An amount saved little by little."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf837fea-f3b5-4126-88b8-4848ba0a547f",
                                                "sense_id": "0f7cad3d-c10d-3bf1-85da-b1882e825746",
                                                "text": "The savings and scrimpings from the cold nights of all his years were ripe to be squandered."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12146a4e-0821-4f14-b3b7-1713359f6c1d",
                                                "sense_id": "0f7cad3d-c10d-3bf1-85da-b1882e825746",
                                                "text": "In her efforts to transform me into the debutante I would never become, my mother spent her scrimpings on private piano, violin, and voice lessons."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "53ddecc5-1434-41f3-a306-6a0fc653e6df",
                        "source_entry_id": "08b2a22b-8a4e-36f3-959a-c6d47c291f47",
                        "source_sense_id": "04499f17-6dc6-3ef2-8e49-7915401b31ea",
                        "target_lang_word": "thrift",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thrift",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "abe5ef8c-81b1-3f15-87cd-758f9ea9483a",
                                        "entry_id": "5761537e-e607-399a-8703-9e1c128236ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristic of using a minimum of something (especially money)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6587db6-7d2f-45e2-a42d-31922702a043",
                                                "sense_id": "abe5ef8c-81b1-3f15-87cd-758f9ea9483a",
                                                "text": "His thrift can be seen in how little the trashman takes from his house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d500680a-4d43-4276-b469-a1989302578b",
                                                "sense_id": "abe5ef8c-81b1-3f15-87cd-758f9ea9483a",
                                                "text": "The rest, […] willing to fall to thrift , as I have seene many souldiers after the service to prove very good husbands"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca0efab1-0183-4c83-b615-72c277bf5c19",
                                                "sense_id": "abe5ef8c-81b1-3f15-87cd-758f9ea9483a",
                                                "text": "[…] it would appear that before taking this precaution Mr. Bree must have had the thrift to remove a modest competency of the gold […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26973723-5515-4eb6-8bf8-d05ee1ebcb0a",
                                                "sense_id": "abe5ef8c-81b1-3f15-87cd-758f9ea9483a",
                                                "text": "The Meaning of Thrift. Thrift implies careful spending, maximum earning, and no wasting. Thrift means much more than the accumulation of a savings account. It means careful and well-considered use of materials as well as money, for even the wise use of money, basic as it is to thrift, is only one phase. Thrift means wise direction of time and effort. It means protection of health. Finally, it means intelligent care of human beings by the community, the State, and the Nation. The best way to begin a thrift movement is by studying simple household problems. From this individual inspection the larger social phases of thrift in community life must develop."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be86c85f-cef3-32ca-82d1-7cb3d6941666",
                                        "entry_id": "5761537e-e607-399a-8703-9e1c128236ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A savings bank."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aca14f6-0a19-4b59-9a17-1ca8c3582f6b",
                                                "sense_id": "be86c85f-cef3-32ca-82d1-7cb3d6941666",
                                                "text": "Usually, home mortgages are obtained from thrifts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b0e202a-c34d-34c7-a27b-ab5a208bd253",
                                        "entry_id": "5761537e-e607-399a-8703-9e1c128236ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various plants of the genus Armeria, particularly Armeria maritima."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5a954c5-f7a8-30ac-aac0-a35d18c56dfa",
                                        "entry_id": "5761537e-e607-399a-8703-9e1c128236ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Success and advance in the acquisition of property; increase of worldly goods; gain; prosperity; profit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c064ec5-1ecf-471f-9378-2db4d546cd66",
                                                "sense_id": "b5a954c5-f7a8-30ac-aac0-a35d18c56dfa",
                                                "text": "Bassanio: […]And many Jasons come in quest of her.\nO my Antonio, had I but the means\nTo hold a rival place with one of them,\nI have a mind presages me such thrift,\nThat I should questionless be fortunate!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86b9864b-b22f-4e92-b9a4-fc65086a7046",
                                                "sense_id": "b5a954c5-f7a8-30ac-aac0-a35d18c56dfa",
                                                "text": "Hamlet: No, let the candied tongue lick absurd pomp,\nAnd crook the pregnant hinges of the knee\nWhere thrift may follow fawning."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4969d63-f6e3-3c7a-a816-448f38d3062a",
                                        "entry_id": "5761537e-e607-399a-8703-9e1c128236ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vigorous growth, as of a plant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thrift",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8e925a6-2afa-3052-b66b-745c18f6ef5d",
                                        "entry_id": "63202a30-ba14-3880-9a70-8256b4a9be64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To shop or browse at a thrift shop; to buy (something) at a thrift shop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79f5cc7a-746e-415d-b29a-bac7e1389c78",
                                                "sense_id": "e8e925a6-2afa-3052-b66b-745c18f6ef5d",
                                                "text": "They like to go thrifting on weekends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d689402f-c25c-4675-aea8-9ea98a8c318f",
                                                "sense_id": "e8e925a6-2afa-3052-b66b-745c18f6ef5d",
                                                "text": "I thrifted these vintage coffee mugs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f534c42b-1a3c-442e-90ab-c548b42e38c5",
                                                "sense_id": "e8e925a6-2afa-3052-b66b-745c18f6ef5d",
                                                "text": "She probably thrifted the T-shirt and shorts. Bought the hiking boots yesterday at Copeland's. She's not much of a hiker, Xerxes thinks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a3c59f73-8b94-42b6-a360-b2bb40da1baa",
                        "source_entry_id": "08b2a22b-8a4e-36f3-959a-c6d47c291f47",
