                                            "reluctant to spend money; close-fisted"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14a9f265-ead5-46a6-a5a8-a0deaa1f06e7",
                                                "sense_id": "6690b0ff-88ec-38b8-abc6-3561c7b77734",
                                                "text": "If there is an overall lesson, it is that train quality should be seen as part of the battle against climate change, with penny-pinching specifications robustly opposed as a false economy."
